WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Calendar view. A month grid of tasks by due date, with undated tasks listed apart.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: month planning.

3
00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:11.900
Calendar puts tasks on their due day.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.330
Move between months…

5
00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.060
…and undated tasks are listed below the grid.

6
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:21.730
Click a task to open it.

7
00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:27.730
A task isn't on the grid: It has no due date — look in the undated list.

8
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:32.230
Month grid by due date
